<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-25T06:31:57.762Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 06:31:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Burkina Faso junta has reinstated the death penalty for terrorism, treason and high crimes, and its army together with Russian mercenaries are accused of new civilian killings, including the discovery of 54 bodies in Tagadayat and strikes across three regions. In Nigeria, suspected bandits killed 37 people in a Taraba border community and at least 10 people in an eastern raid, while militants killed 14 security personnel at a base. Two European women held captive for more than a year were freed in Libya after being held in Niger. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZ9IBY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1fT3Y1SmgzVkgwcldVSEE4TVhadm1LeXhkeW1hclBrMFNyQ0JPYXZhOWc5ZGNVTHVwRE9kcFRXa1d2d283YkdHZFhEVW02UHhkWThWclY4eVlpUjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOOUVqNllZMWlndnZmX3dxamhYM25iZ3FIemFyRy1sbFB0cHhkY2RfQkpkaldkWHA0ZVFEclJpRnZGeXVlNXp5Tnh5RjRiTGRQeGN1eUlhNXM5RWNCRmpwRWRUQldHX25PWjVES2xmREpaaW5vQUZlZmFybldfV1JNQU1OdUpzOFVHN1NhX2xDeDNxOEpBSGUyel9MbDBNUkpKc3l3TnNqNkh3NjVZLTh4UnlvTVFycjNp?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOUExwODlWYVI3dDY3eGw0SlhiVkRmclZ5NlZTUkR1NHpGNjZ1TV9WU0QxTkRTSzRvYmxCZllFVlJ